--[[
	Reference registry of every `Info` flag read by TagHumanoid.server.luau (WorldHandler/TagHumanoid/init.server.luau
	after the item-3 split). `Info` is the ad hoc table each move script builds before calling
	HitDetection.magnitudeCheck/SMag or firing ServerStorage.Requests.TagHumanoid directly — there is no
	enforced schema (see CLAUDE.md refactor item 2), so this module is documentation-as-code only: it is
	NOT required by any runtime code and does NOT validate anything. Its purpose is to give a single place
	to check for name collisions/typos when adding a new move, and to record which flags look unused so a
	future cleanup pass has a starting point instead of re-deriving this from scratch.

	Each entry: FlagName = "what it does (first read at TagHumanoid line N as of the item-3 split)".
	Line numbers refer to the pre-split TagHumanoid.server.luau; re-check after further edits to that file.
]]

